error: `ping` holds the thread until it is done, and an async function does not hold its thread
  `ping` calls `send`, which waits for the network
  the tasks of async functions share a few threads: one that holds its thread keeps the others from running
  --> error_udp_send_through_call.sg:7:9
 7 |     try ping(read socket)
   |         ^^^^
  hint: a function that does it runs on a thread of its own with `await Task.run(work, x)`
